Z||000000||Formula88||04-12-2001||12:08 PM||||Ok, all the comparisons I've seen about the Spintech mufflers say they flow better than Flowmasters and are quiter.  What I haven't seen are any comparisons to the stock V6 exhaust.  Obviously it'll flow better, but how does the sound compare?  It is much louder than stock?  I'm thinking about one for my Formula, possibly removing the cat, too.  Can't decide on that one.  That would be for off road use only, though.  ||||reg||5
Z||000001||c m west||04-12-2001||02:10 PM||||We have used the Spintech muffler on several cars here and have noticed a better sound as far as not being as obnoxious as the flowmaster- as far as power rating we have yet to dyno the two, however, I cant see that much difference between the two - all up to owner preference<P>Eric - West Coast Fiero <A HREF="http://www.cwestco.com" TARGET=_blank>www.cwestco.com</A> <BR>310-305-4111||||reg||1
